hadiths[30]{hadithnumber,text}:
"590","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) jab raat ko tahajjud key liye uthtey to farmatey: Ae Allah! Terey liye hamd hai. Tu aasmaanon aur zameen aur jo un mein hain unka qaem rakhney wala hai. Aur terey liye hamd hai. Terey liye aasmaanon aur zameen aur jo un mein hain unki baadshahat hai. Aur terey liye hamd hai. Tu aasmaanon aur zameen aur jo un mein hain unka noor hai. Aur terey liye hamd hai. Tu aasmaanon aur zameen ka baadshah hai. Aur terey liye hamd hai. Tu haq hai. Aur tera waada haq hai. Aur tujh se mulaaqaat haq hai. Aur tera qaul haq hai. Aur Jannat haq hai. Aur aag haq hai. Aur Nabi haq hain. Aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) haq hain. Aur Qiyaamat haq hai. Ae Allah! Main ne terey liye farmabardaari ki aur tujh par imaan laaya aur tujh par bharosa kya aur teri taraf rujoo kya aur teri madad se jhagda kya aur teri taraf faisla ley gaya. To mujhey maaf farma jo main ne aagey bheja aur jo peechey kya aur jo chhupaaya aur jo zaahir kya. Tu aagey karney wala hai aur tu peechey karney wala hai. Terey siwa koi mabood nahi ya terey siwa koi mabood nahi. Aur Allah key siwa koi taaqat aur quwwat nahi. (Bukhari: 1120)"
"591","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki zindagi mein jab khwaab dekhta to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par bayan karta. To main ne tamanna ki ke main khwaab dekhun aur use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par bayan karun. Aur main jawan ladka tha aur main Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein masjid mein sota tha. To main ne neend mein dekha goya do farishton ne mujhey pakad liya aur mujhey aag ki taraf ley gaey. Phir wo kuwein key modney ki tarah modi hui thi aur uskey do seeng they. Aur us mein log they jinhey main ne pehchaana tha. To main kehney laga: Main aag se Allah ki panaah maangta hun. Unhon-ne kaha: To ham se aik doosra farishta mila aur us ne mujh se kaha: Tumhey daraaya nahi gaya. To main ne use Hafsa par bayan kya. To Hafsa ne use Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) par bayan kya. To Aap ne farmaya: Abdullah achha aadmi hai, kaash wo raat mein namaz padhta. To uskey baad wo raat mein thodi der key siwa na sota tha. (Bukhari: 1121)"
"592","[AI-translation] Jundub bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) beemaar huey aur aik ya do raatein (tahajjud key liye) na uthay. (Bukhari: 1124)"
"593","[AI-translation] Ali bin Abi Taalib (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ko unkey aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki beti Faatima key paas aey aur farmaya: Kya tum donon namaz nahi padhtey? To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Hamaari jaanein Allah key haath mein hain. Phir jab wo chaahega ke hamein uthaaey to uthaaeyga. To Aap wapas aey jab ham ne aisa kaha aur meri taraf koi baat wapas na ki. Phir main ne Aap ko suna jabke Aap peeth mor kar jaa rahey they, apni raan par maartey huey aur farmatey huey: (Aur insaan har cheez se badh kar jhagda karney wala hai). (Bukhari: 1127)"
"594","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) amal chhorey rakhtey they jabke Aap pasand kartey ke us par amal karein, is khauf se ke log us par amal karein aur un par farz kar diya jaey. Aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Chaasht ki nafl kabhi nahi padhi. Aur beshak main use padhti hun. (Bukhari: 1128)"
"595","[AI-translation] Mugheera bin Shoaba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Beshak Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) namaz padhney key liye khadey hotey yahan tak ke Aap key donon qadam ya donon pindliyaan sooj jaatein. To Aap se kaha jaata. To Aap farmatey: Kya main shukr guzaar banda na banun. (Bukhari: 1130)"
"596","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: Allah ko sab se mehboob namaz Dawood (Alaihissalam) ki namaz hai. Aur Allah ko sab se mehboob rozah Dawood ka rozah hai. Aur wo aadhi raat sotey aur tihaai (mein) khadey hotey aur chhathaa (hissa) sotey. Aur aik din rozah rakhtey aur aik din iftaar kartey. (Bukhari: 1131)"
"597","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko sab se mehboob amal hamesha (karney wala) tha. Un se kaha gaya: Aap kab uthtey they? Unhon-ne kaha: Aap uthtey they jab murgh ki aawaaz suntey. (Bukhari: 1132)"
"598","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai: Jab murgh ki aawaaz suntey to uthay aur namaz padhtey. (Bukhari: 1132)"
"599","[AI-translation] Aur aik riwayat mein hai unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se), unhon-ne kaha: Mujhey sehri merey paas na paati magar sotey huey, yaani Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko. (Bukhari: 1133)"
"600","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath raat ko namaz padhi. To Aap musalsal khadey rahey yahan tak ke main ne burey kaam ka iraada kya. Ham ne kaha: Aur tum ne kya iraada kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne iraada kya ke baith jaaun aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko chhor dun. (Bukhari: 1135)"
"601","[AI-translation] Ibn Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki namaz terah rakatein thi. Yaani raat mein. (Bukhari: 1138)"
"602","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) raat ko terah rakatein padhtey they. Un mein witr aur Fajr ki do rakatein (shaamil thein). (Bukhari: 1140)"
"603","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) mahiney mein iftaar kartey yahan tak ke ham gumaan kartey ke Aap us mein rozah na rakkhengey. Aur rozah rakhtey yahan tak ke ham gumaan kartey ke Aap us mein kuchh iftaar na karengey. Aur tum Aap ko raat mein namaz padhtey huey dekhna na chaaho magar dekhtey. Aur na sotey huey magar dekhtey. (Bukhari: 1141)"
"604","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Shaitaan tum mein se kisi key sar key peechey jab wo sota hai teen girah lagaata hai. Har girah par maar key (kehta hai): Tum par lambi raat hai, to so jao. Phir agar wo jaaga aur Allah ko yaad kya to girah khul jaati hai. Phir agar wuzu kya to girah khul jaati hai. Phir agar namaz padhi to girah khul jaati hai. To wo subah chaust paak dil hota hai. Warna subah ganda dil sust hota hai. (Bukhari: 1142)"
"605","[AI-translation] Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aik aadmi ka zikr kya gaya. To kaha gaya: Wo musalsal sota raha yahan tak ke subah ho gai. Wo namaz key liye na utha. To Aap ne farmaya: Shaitaan ne uskey kaan mein peshaab kar diya hai. (Bukhari: 1144)"
"606","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Hamaara Rab har raat Aasmaan-e-Duniya ki taraf utarta hai jab aakhri tihaai raat baaqi rehti hai. Farmaata hai: Kaun mujhey pukaarta hai to main usey jawaab dun. Kaun mujh se maangta hai to main usey dun. Kaun mujh se maghfirat maangta hai to main usey maaf karun. (Bukhari: 1145)"
"607","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke un se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki raat ki namaz key baarey mein poochha gaya. Unhon-ne kaha: Aap uskey awwal hissey mein sotey aur uskey aakhir mein uthtey aur namaz padhtey, phir apne bistar ki taraf wapas aatey. Phir jab moazzin azaan kehta to uthtey. Phir agar Aap ko haajat hoti to ghusl kartey warna wuzu kartey aur nikaltey. (Bukhari: 1146)"
"608","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke un se Aap (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ki Ramazan mein namaz key baarey mein poochha gaya. To unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Ramazan aur na uskey siwa mein gyaarah rakatein par izaafa na kartey they. Chaar padhtey, to unkey husn aur tool key baarey mein na poochho. Phir chaar padhtey, to unkey husn aur tool key baarey mein na poochho. Phir teen padhtey. Unhon-ne kaha: To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Kya Aap witr padhney se pehley sotey hain? To Aap ne farmaya: Ae Aisha! Beshak meri aankhein soti hain aur mera dil nahi sota. (Bukhari: 1147). Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne Fajr ki namaz key waqt Bilaal se farmaya: Ae Bilaal! Mujhey apna sab se ummeed wala amal bata jo tune Islam mein kya hai. Beshak main ne Jannat mein apne saamney tumhaarey jooton ki aawaaz suni hai. Unhon-ne kaha: Main ne apne paas zyada ummeed wala amal nahi kya ke main ne raat ya din ki kisi ghadi mein paaki haasil nahi ki magar us paaki key sath namaz padhi jitni merey liye likhi gai ke main padhun. Abu Abdullah ne kaha: Tumhaarey jooton ki aawaaz yaani harkat. (1149). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"609","[AI-translation] Anas bin Maalik (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) daakhil huey to rassi do sutoonon key darmiyaan khinchi hui thi. To Aap ne farmaya: Ye rassi kaisi hai? Unhon-ne kaha: Ye Zainab ki rassi hai. Phir jab wo sust hotin to us se latak jaatin. To Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Nahi, use kholo. Tum mein se koi apni chausti mein namaz padhey. Phir jab wo sust ho to baith jaey. (Bukhari: 1150)"
"610","[AI-translation] Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujh se farmaya: Ae Abdullah! Fulaan jaisa na hona jo raat ko khada hota tha phir raat ko khada hona chhor diya. (Bukhari: 1152)"
"611","[AI-translation] Ubada bin Saamit (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo raat ko jaaga aur kaha: Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi, Akela, uska koi shareek nahi. Uskey liye baadshahat hai aur uskey liye hamd hai aur wo har cheez par qaadir hai. Tamaam tareefein Allah key liye aur Allah paak hai aur Allah key siwa koi mabood nahi aur Allah sab se bada hai aur Allah key siwa koi taaqat aur quwwat nahi. Phir kaha: Ae Allah mujhey maaf farma, ya dua ki to uskey liye qabool ki jaaeygi. Phir agar wuzu kya aur namaz padhi to uski namaz qabool ki jaaeygi. (Bukhari: 1154)"
"612","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon-ne apne qisson mein qissa bayan kartey huey kaha jabke wo Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ka zikr kar rahey they: Beshak tumhara aik bhai behuda baat nahi kehta. Us se muraad Abdullah bin Rawaaha (Raziallahu anhu) hain: Aur ham mein Rasulullah uski Kitaab padhtey hain jab chamakta hua subah ka ujaala phat-ta hai. Unhon-ne hamein andhey honay key baad hidaayat dikhaai, to hamaarey dil us par yaqeen rakhtey hain ke jo unhon-ne kaha waaqe honay wala hai. Wo raat ko apna pehlu apne bistar se door rakhtey hain jab mushrikeen key sath bistar bhaari hotey hain. (Bukhari: 1155)"
"613","[AI-translation] Ibn Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main ne Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key zamaaney mein dekha goya merey haath mein resham ka tukda hai. To goya main Jannat mein koi jagah nahi chaahta magar wo uski taraf udta hai. Aur main ne dekha goya do (farishtey) merey paas aey. Aur baaqi hadees zikr ki aur wo guzar chuki hai. (Bukhari: 1156)"
"614","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) hamein tamaam muamlaat mein istikhara sikhaatey they jaisey hamein Quran ki surat sikhaatey. Farmaatey: Jab tum mein se koi kaam ka iraada karey to farz key siwa do rakatein padhey, phir kahey: Ae Allah! Beshak main tujh se terey ilm key sath bhalai maangta hun aur tujh se teri qudrat key sath taaqat maangta hun aur tujh se terey azim fazl se maangta hun. Beshak tu taaqat rakhta hai aur main taaqat nahi rakhta. Aur tu jaanta hai aur main nahi jaanta. Aur tu ghaibon ko jaanney wala hai. Ae Allah! Agar tu jaanta hai ke ye kaam merey liye merey deen aur meri guzraan aur merey kaam key anjaam mein behtar hai. Ya farmaya: Merey kaam key haazir aur mustaqbil mein. To use merey liye muqaddar kar dey aur use merey liye aasaan kar dey, phir us mein merey liye barkat dey. Aur agar tu jaanta hai ke ye kaam merey liye merey deen aur meri guzraan aur merey kaam key anjaam mein bura hai. Ya farmaya: Merey kaam key haazir aur mustaqbil mein. To use mujh se pher dey aur mujhey us se pher dey. Aur merey liye bhalai muqaddar kar dey jahaan ho, phir mujhey us par raazi kar dey. Unhon-ne kaha: Aur wo apni haajat ka naam ley. (Bukhari: 1166)"
"615","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) nafli namazon mein se kisi par Fajr ki do rakatein ki pabandi se zyada pabandi na kartey they. (Bukhari: 1163)"
"616","[AI-translation] Aur unhi se (Aisha Raziallahu anha se) riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Subah ki namaz se pehley ki do rakatein halki kartey they yahan tak ke main kehti ke kya Aap ne Umm-ul-Kitaab padhi hai. (Bukhari: 1165)"
"617","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Merey khaleel (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne mujhey teen (baaton) ki wasiyat ki, main unhey marney tak na chhorunga: Har mahiney mein teen din key rozey aur Chaasht ki namaz aur witr par soney ki. (Bukhari: 1178)"
"618","[AI-translation] Aisha (Raziallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) Zohar se pehley chaar aur Subah se pehley do na chhorey rakhtey they. (Bukhari: 1182)"
"619","[AI-translation] Abdullah Muzani (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Maghrib ki namaz se pehley namaz padho. Teesri mein farmaya: Jo chaahaaey. Is naapasandgi se ke log use sunnat bana lein. (Bukhari: 1183). Makkah aur Madina ki masjid mein namaz ki fazeelat ki kitaab."
